{"url":"https://www.saudia.com/en-SA/explore/about-saudia/saudia-history","status":200,"title":"Saudia Historical Highlights | Saudia","desc":"Explore the rich legacy and milestones of Saudia. From our founding to global leadership, discover our company history and historical highlights. Learn more today!","finalUrl":"https://www.saudia.com/en-SA/explore/about-saudia/saudia-history","bodyClass":"white-theme baseLang withTravelNotice mWebHomePage","h":4015,"sig":[{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-image-link-list"],"h":600,"headings":1,"imgs":1,"text":14},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-title-text"],"h":539,"headings":1,"imgs":9,"text":1975},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-space"],"h":56,"headings":0,"imgs":0,"text":0},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-tabs"],"h":1300,"headings":1,"imgs":4,"text":4315}],"h1":["Saudia Historical Highlights | Saudia","Saudia History"],"html":"<sc-placeholder _ngcontent-saudiawebapp-c260489156=\"\" name=\"jss-main\"><!----><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-image-link-list class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"custom-carousel imagelinklist--content-embedded h--left v--top image--slider ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div appswiper=\"\" fxflex=\"auto\" class=\"swiper-container ng-star-inserted swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-backface-hidden\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"swiper-slide ng-star-inserted swiper-slide-active\"><div fxlayout=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"\" fxflexfill=\"\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"swiper-slide__image desktop-view ng-star-inserted\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"600\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Live-images/Campaign-Banner/2024/04/our-network.ashx?h=600&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1920&amp;rev=e2768e4f88904bb1b1f1a61a41d9a908&amp;hash=1CE2AB2D29E976DF8BFE2C871A5076A2\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"59e796f5-3e26-496b-8e61-890125891702\"></div></div><!----><!----><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"swiper-slide__content\"><!----><!----><h1 appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Saudia History</span><!----></h1><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div class=\"custom-pagination ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div id=\"cpage_banner\" class=\"custom-pages\"></div></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></app-jss-image-link-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n<section class=\"saudia-history-section-en\">\n<h2>Saudia Historical Highlights</h2>\n<!-- Image Gallery -->\n<div class=\"saudia-history-gallery-en\" aria-label=\"Saudia airline historical photo gallery\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Saudia-airline-historical-photo/1.ashx?h=104&amp;w=150&amp;rev=2e0b1ae3dd0e40918cdfb770ba34c4cc&amp;hash=DC10F35BCE379F713296666A92BCDB00\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Saudia-airline-historical-photo/2.ashx?h=111&amp;w=150&amp;rev=66ae5673f05d44c4b7f8c7be091013f9&amp;hash=A4C643A868BAAD41B7CC98415057D5F6\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Saudia-airline-historical-photo/5.ashx?h=113&amp;w=150&amp;rev=b96d79740d394c92850b082707af252f&amp;hash=F9A40FBFA22CE73344ADEB3C45BC1B19\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Saudia-airline-historical-photo/6.ashx?h=110&amp;w=150&amp;rev=7532d8c748a1443fbc45ca01e37df2ec&amp;hash=BCB2BF334C4A876328148163DF3A5315\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Saudia-airline-historical-photo/7.ashx?h=99&amp;w=150&amp;rev=cc240eac848a4722b4d9383b7e16db10&amp;hash=ABF411B6C2F11C174749F56DDA6B62D7\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Saudia-airline-historical-photo/9.ashx?h=100&amp;w=150&amp;rev=92cb45cc858449079b907954eb43f5eb&amp;hash=CBAB45047B149F857DA70402F40AE549\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Saudia-airline-historical-photo/8.ashx?h=93&amp;w=150&amp;rev=1050f9b0a83045fbb1e4df8a26106512&amp;hash=F2CB3E11313155112B01BD5661ECA683\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Saudia-airline-historical-photo/10.ashx?h=122&amp;w=150&amp;rev=bd35e1f892fe46bbbb9542a30ce23f2c&amp;hash=073992884EEB32B86ECFE8D115775874\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Saudia-airline-historical-photo/Saudia_787_Tower_02.ashx?h=100&amp;w=150&amp;rev=d97cfb73754f4c37b76cf19e7aaa9ee1&amp;hash=8BBEA84B09D4B8EA3C2F20AE9493BA19\">\n&nbsp;</div>\n<!-- Text Content -->\n<p>\nSaudia started out in <strong>1945</strong> with a single twin-engine DC-3 (Dakota) HZ-AAX given to King Abdulaziz\nby U.S. President Franklin D. Roosevelt. Months later, two additional DC-3s were purchased, forming the nucleus of\nwhat would soon become one of the world’s major airlines.\n</p>\n<p>\nToday, Saudia operates a modern fleet of <strong>142 aircraft</strong>, including the latest and most advanced\nwide-bodied jets: B787-9, B777-268L, B777-300ER, Airbus A320-200, Airbus A321, and Airbus A330-300.\n</p>\n<p>\nBelow are some of the most important historical highlights of Saudia since its establishment, tracing its evolution\ninto one of the best airlines in the world.\n</p>\n</section></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-tabs class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-tab-container\"><mat-tab-group animationduration=\"0ms\" class=\"mat-tab-group mat-primary ng-star-inserted\"><mat-tab-header class=\"mat-tab-header\"><button aria-hidden=\"false\" type=\"button\" mat-ripple=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-header-pagination mat-tab-header-pagination-before mat-elevation-z4 mat-tab-header-pagination-disabled\" disabled=\"\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\"><div class=\"mat-tab-header-pagination-chevron\"></div></button><div class=\"mat-tab-label-container\"><div role=\"tablist\" class=\"mat-tab-list\"><div class=\"mat-tab-labels\"><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator mat-tab-label-active ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-0\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-posinset=\"1\" aria-setsize=\"8\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">1950s<!----><!----><!----></div></div><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-1\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"2\" aria-setsize=\"8\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">1960s<!----><!----><!----></div></div><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"3\" aria-setsize=\"8\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-2\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">1970s<!----><!----><!----></div></div><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"4\" aria-setsize=\"8\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-3\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">1980s<!----><!----><!----></div></div><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"5\" aria-setsize=\"8\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-4\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">1990s<!----><!----><!----></div></div><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-5\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"6\" aria-setsize=\"8\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-5\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">2000s<!----><!----><!----></div></div><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-6\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"7\" aria-setsize=\"8\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-6\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">2010s<!----><!----><!----></div></div><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-7\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"8\" aria-setsize=\"8\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-7\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">2020s<!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----></div><mat-ink-bar class=\"mat-ink-bar\"></mat-ink-bar></div></div><button aria-hidden=\"false\" type=\"button\" mat-ripple=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-header-pagination mat-tab-header-pagination-after mat-elevation-z4 mat-tab-header-pagination-disabled\" disabled=\"\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next slide\"><div class=\"mat-tab-header-pagination-chevron\"></div></button></mat-tab-header><div class=\"mat-tab-body-wrapper\"><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-26 mat-tab-body-active ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-0\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-26 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----><div class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<div id=\"history-1950\" class=\"collapse-body collapse show\" aria-labelledby=\"history-1950\" data-parent=\".accordion\">\n  <h3 class=\"fs-1-3 vg-0--top\">History of the 40-50's</h3>\n\n  <div class=\"history-table-wrapper\">\n    <table class=\"table-ui history-table\">\n     \n      <thead class=\"only-for-desktop\">\n        <tr>\n          <th colspan=\"3\">The 1940–1950 History</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\"><strong>1945</strong></span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">\n              U.S. President Roosevelt gives King Abdul Aziz a gift of a Douglas DC-3 Dakota\n              following their historic meeting in the Suez Canal on February 14, 1945. The DC-3\n              was used on routes between Riyadh, Jeddah and Dhahran and carried both passengers and cargo.\n              Two more DC-3s were purchased within months.\n            </span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">\n              <img alt=\"Saudia DC-3 aircraft in the 1940s\" src=\"https://www.saudia.com/pages/-/media/Project/SA/SC/static_files/aboutus/history/40s.jpg?rev=0460123732e8468f8fc1474764b192b2&amp;hash=4BD79AD45A31AF02833151AB9ECED573\">\n            </span>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\"><strong>1946</strong></span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">\n              Saudia was set up as an operating agency of the Ministry of Defense.\n              The airline's first airport and operating base was located at Kandara,\n              close to what is today the downtown area of Jeddah. Haj pilgrims were\n              flown to Jeddah from Lydda, Palestine and other countries. In the same year,\n              Saudia requested permission for charter flights to London.\n            </span>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"bt-hide\"></td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\"><strong>1947</strong></span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">\n              Two more Dakotas were purchased and scheduled services were operated both within the Kingdom\n              and to regional destinations such as Cairo and Damascus. The first scheduled domestic service\n              took place on March 14th.\n            </span>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"bt-hide\"></td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\"><strong>1948</strong></span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">Service started to Beirut.</span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">\n              <img alt=\"Historic Saudia aircraft in the 1950s\" src=\"https://www.saudia.com/pages/-/media/Project/SA/SC/static_files/aboutus/history/50s.jpg?rev=ea8bb43ea9634d4fb6e1af94b25f4576&amp;hash=AC250245E656A3C294D415C6A54780E1\">\n            </span>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\"><strong>1949</strong></span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">\n              The first of five Bristol 170s, Mark 21-E variant, adaptable for passengers or freight, was delivered.\n            </span>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"bt-hide\"></td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\"><strong>1952</strong></span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">\n              Five four-engine Douglas DC-4s were purchased, their greater range permitting\n              operations to Middle Eastern destinations. Service started to Amman and Karachi.\n            </span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">\n              <img alt=\"Saudia DC-4 aircraft serving regional routes\" src=\"https://www.saudia.com/pages/-/media/Project/SA/SC/static_files/aboutus/history/60s.jpg?rev=801acd13f38748a39255536474fa7436&amp;hash=99F051812B1FF5F9CEEF9B3531338501\">\n            </span>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\"><strong>1953</strong></span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">\n              Services between Dhahran and Beirut were inaugurated, in addition to starting service\n              to Port Sudan, Asmara, Istanbul and Kuwait.\n            </span>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"bt-hide\"></td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\"><strong>1954</strong></span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">\n              Ten Convair 340s, the airline's first pressurized aircraft, were purchased and delivered\n              between 1954 and 1955.<br><br>\n              In the same year, the first flight landed to TUU station by Dakota (DC-3, 24 seats)\n              on a sand runway.\n            </span>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"bt-hide\"></td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\"><strong>1955</strong></span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">\n              By its tenth anniversary, the airline had brought all outlying communities of the Kingdom\n              to within a few hours' journey of each other, both to and from Riyadh and Jeddah,\n              which is the local transport hub for the annual Haj pilgrimage.\n              The first maintenance shops were built in Jeddah.\n            </span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">\n              <img alt=\"Saudia aircraft and maintenance facilities in the 1950s\" src=\"https://www.saudia.com/pages/-/media/Project/SA/SC/static_files/aboutus/history/90s.jpg?rev=ab366f6f0f514fb29465b54443e33190&amp;hash=283A4932743F159C7280EDC0621BC885\">\n            </span>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\"><strong>1959</strong></span>\n          </td>\n          <td data-th=\"The 1940-1950 History\">\n            <span class=\"bt-content\">\n              In April of this year, a daily air shuttle service between Jeddah and Riyadh was inaugurated,\n              using the pressurized Convair-Liners.\n            </span>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"bt-hide\"></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</span><!----></p><!----></div><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-27 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-1\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-27 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-28 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-2\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-28 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-29 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-3\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-3\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-29 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-30 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-4\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-4\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-30 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-31 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-5\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-5\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-31 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-32 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-6\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-6\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-32 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-33 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-7\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-7\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-33 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><!----></div></mat-tab-group><!----></div></app-jss-tabs><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}